<quiz>
    <question type="stack">
        <name>
            <text>7.3.2.4 Compute a cofactor</text>
        </name>
        <questiontext format="html">
            <text><![CDATA[
<p class="HELM_exercise">
    <span class="multilang" lang="en">
        Exercise
    </span>
    <span class="multilang" lang="de">
        Übung
    </span>
</p>
<p>
    <span class="multilang" lang="en">
        Consider the matrix \(A = {@matrixa@}\). Compute the cofactors of the following entries:
    </span>
    <span class="multilang" lang="de">
        Betrachten Sie die Matrix \(A = {@matrixa@}\). Berechnen Sie die Kofaktoren der folgenden Einträge:
    </span>
</p>
<ol class="HELM_parts">
    <li>
        <span class="multilang" lang="en">
            The cofactor of \(a_{22}\) is:
        </span>
        <span class="multilang" lang="de">
            Der Kofaktor von \(a_{22}\) ist:
        </span>
        [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]] [[feedback:prt1]]
    </li>
    <li>
        <span class="multilang" lang="en">
            The cofactor of \(a_{23}\) is:
        </span>
        <span class="multilang" lang="de">
            Der Kofaktor von \(a_{23}\) ist:
        </span>
        [[input:ans2]] [[validation:ans2]] [[feedback:prt2]]
    </li>
</ol>
]]></text>
        </questiontext>
        <generalfeedback format="html">
            <text><![CDATA[
<p>
    <span class="multilang" lang="en">
        We are given the matrix \(A = {@matrixa@}.\)
    </span>
    <span class="multilang" lang="de">
        Wir haben die Matrix \(A = {@matrixa@}\) gegeben.
    </span>
</p>
<ol class="HELM_parts">
    <li>
        <span class="multilang" lang="en">
            The minor of \(a_{22}\) is the \(2\times2\) determinant \(\begin{vmatrix}a_{11} &amp; a_{13} \\ a_{31} &amp; a_{33}\end{vmatrix}=a_{11}a_{33}-a_{31}a_{13}\). In this case, the minor is: \[\begin{vmatrix}{@AA[1,1]@} &amp; {@AA[1,3]@} \\ {@AA[3,1]@}
                        &amp; {@AA[3,3]@}\end{vmatrix} = {@minorA22@} = {@ta1@}\]
        </span>
        <span class="multilang" lang="de">
            Der Minor von \(a_{22}\) ist die \(2\times2\)-Determinante \(\begin{vmatrix}a_{11} &amp; a_{13 } \\ a_{31} &amp; a_{33}\end{vmatrix}=a_{11}a_{33}-a_{31}a_{13}\). In diesem Fall ist der Minor: \[\begin{vmatrix}{@AA[1,1]@} &amp; {@AA[1,3]@} \\ {@AA[3,1]@}
                        &amp; {@AA[3,3]@}\end{vmatrix} = {@minorA22@} = {@ta1@}\]
        </span>
        <p>
        </p>
        <p>
            <span class="multilang" lang="en">
                The sign in the position of \(a_{22}\) in the array of signs is \(+\), the cofactor of \(a_{22}\) is \(A_{22}=+{@ta1@}\).
            </span>
            <span class="multilang" lang="de">
                Das Vorzeichen an der Position von \(a_{22}\) in der Vorzeichnmatrix ist \(+\), der Kofaktor von \(a_{22}\) ist \(A_{22}=+{@ta1@}\).
            </span>
        </p>
    </li>
    <li>
        <span class="multilang" lang="en">
            The minor of \(a_{22}\) is the \(2\times2\) determinant \(\begin{vmatrix}a_{11} &amp; a_{12} \\ a_{31} &amp; a_{32}\end{vmatrix}=a_{11}a_{32}-a_{31}a_{12}\). In this case, the minor is: \[\begin{vmatrix}{@AA[1,1]@} &amp; {@AA[1,2]@} \\ {@AA[3,1]@}
                        &amp; {@AA[3,2]@}\end{vmatrix} = {@minorA23@} = {@minorA23s@}\]
        </span>
        <span class="multilang" lang="de">
            Der Minor von \(a_{22}\) ist die \(2\times2\)-Determinante \(\begin{vmatrix}a_{11} &amp; a_{12 } \\ a_{31} &amp; a_{32}\end{vmatrix}=a_{11}a_{32}-a_{31}a_{12}\). In diesem Fall ist der Minor: \[\begin{vmatrix}{@AA[1,1]@} &amp; {@AA[1,2]@} \\ {@AA[3,1]@}
                        &amp; {@AA[3,2]@}\end{vmatrix} = {@minorA23@} = {@minorA23s@}\]
        </span>
        <p>
        </p>
        <p>
            <span class="multilang" lang="en">
                sign in the position of \(a_{23}\) in the array of signs is \(-\), so the cofactor of \(a_{23}\) is \(A_{23}={@cofA23@}\).
            </span>
            <span class="multilang" lang="de">
                Das Vorzeichen an der Position von \(a_{23}\) in der Vorzeichenmatrix ist \(-\), also ist der Kofaktor von \(a_{23}\) \(A_{23}={@cofA23@}\).
            </span>
        </p>
    </li>
</ol>
]]></text>
        </generalfeedback>
